OL,3,AWhy smoky bacon crisps threaten to
OL,4,Areignite rows over EU rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe naming of smoky bacon-flavoured
OL,7,Fcrisps has become the latest political
OL,8,Fheadache to emerge from the
OL,9,Fgovernment's bid for closer ties with
OL,10,Fthe EU.
OL,12,FThe government is negotiating a deal on
OL,13,Ffood standards in a bid to cut costs
OL,14,Ffor British companies trading with
OL,15,FEurope.
OL,17,FLabour ministers have been keen to talk
OL,18,Fup the potential economic benefits of
OL,19,Fthe agreement, which could be announced
OL,20,Fat a summit later this month.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
