OL,3,AWhy smoky bacon crisps threaten to
OL,4,Areignite rows over EU rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the deal's requirement for Britain
OL,7,Fto adopt EU food rules in a wide range
OL,8,Fof areas has threatened to reignite
OL,9,Fsovereignty debates from the Brexit
OL,10,Fera.
